     **What was wrong and what was fixed:**
     
     | Bug | Root[0m[2m cause | Fix |
     |-----|-----------|-----|
     | Overselling | `check_stock` → `charge` → `decrement` had a race window; concurrent requests could all pass the[0m[2m check before any decremented | New `reserve(quantity)` method holds a lock while checking and decrementing atomically |
[0m[2m| Ghost charges | If `charge` succeeded but `decrement` failed (stock taken by a concurrent request), customer was charged with[0m[2m no item | `reserve` guarantees stock is set aside before payment; on payment[0m[2m failure, `inventory.increment` restores it immediately |
     
